{
  "name": "Webhook 範例 5：GitHub 事件通知與安全驗證",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🐙 範例 5：GitHub 事件通知與安全驗證\n\nGitHub 專案有動靜時（推送程式碼、開 Issue、按星星），GitHub 主動呼叫 n8n，n8n 寄 Email 通知你。\n\n1. **驗證密鑰**：網址要帶 `?token=` 且和「設定」節點相同，否則回傳 401\n2. **Switch**：依 Header `x-github-event` 分流\n3. 每種事件整理成不同內容的信件 ➔ Gmail ➔ 回傳 200\n\n⚙️ 修改「設定」節點的 `secret_token` 與 `notify_email`；GitHub 需要連得到你的 n8n（ngrok / Cloudflare Tunnel / n8n Cloud）",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 600
      },
      "id": "5e86ade3-ee54-5a3e-8179-df20fcd6c0b2",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "github-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0b1de2be-7434-57be-a2ae-86ce8f2d7a31",
